tbody></table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/o/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBxTXR3SDVqTGNCQWFGSkZSYVRkXzZQcHA5RW1jNnBYQT09In0=\" style=\"height: 1px !important; max-height: 1px !important; max-width: 1px !important; width: 1px !important; display: none !important;\" alt=\"\">', 'CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHey 8umairali,\r\n\r\nI noticed your first CodeRabbit review hasn’t run yet.\r\n\r\nMost teams use CodeRabbit to reduce review overhead and catch issues earlier. Based on our ROI model:\r\n\r\n* ~25% less manual review time (devs spend ~6 hrs/week reviewing)\r\n* Up to 50% fewer bugs reaching production\r\n* Up to 57x annual ROI in a 100-dev scenario\r\n\r\nWant the full breakdown?\r\nDownload the full ROI report here. ( https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/1775154860097_ROI%20Summary%20(2)_01KN7QK4D39VK1MFS3X5AVRNAE.pdf )\r\n\r\nTrigger a review through any of these steps:\r\n\r\n1. Open or update a PR.\r\n2. Comment: @coderabbitai review\r\n3. Resolve one suggestion to move forward.\r\n\r\nQuick learning resources:\r\nQuickstart docs ( https://docs.coderabbit.ai/getting-started/quickstart )\r\n • \r\nWatch demo ( https://youtu.be/plAFAjMIMm4 )\r\n\r\nTrigger your first review ( https://app.coderabbit.ai/login )\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nPreet\r\n\r\nCodeRabbit\r\n201 Spear Street Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAPqMtwH5jLcBAaFJFRaTd_6Ppp9Emc6pXA== )\r\n | \r\nManage preferences ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAPqMtwH5jLcBAaFJFRaTd_6Ppp9Emc6pXA== )', 'Your first review hasn’t run yet — need help?', 'hello@coderabbit.ai', 'The CodeRabbit Team', '[\"umair1@dahimail.com\"]', '[]', '[]', '<20261017085801.9170f7ce392e4c68@cio127296.coderabbit.ai>', NULL, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'neutral', NULL, 'delivered', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-10-17 06:58:01', '2026-10-17 06:58:01', NULL, NULL, NULL,