lier. Based on our ROI model:\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 18px 0;\">\r\n                      <tbody><tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e4e1d9; border-radius:8px; padding:14px;\">\r\n                          <ul style=\"margin:0 0 10px 18px; padding:0; font-size:13px; line-height:18px; color:#111111;\">\r\n                            <li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\r\n                              ~25% less manual review time (devs spend ~6 hrs/week reviewing)\r\n                            </li>\r\n                            <li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\r\n                              Up to 50% fewer bugs reaching production\r\n                            </li>\r\n                            <li style=\"margin:0;\">\r\n                              Up to 57x annual ROI in a 100-dev scenario\r\n                            </li>\r\n                          </ul>\r\n                           <p style=\"margin:0 0 1px 0; font-size:12px; line-height:20px;\">\r\n                      Want the full breakdown?\r\n                      <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.\" style=\"color:#ff5a1f; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:600;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                        Download the full ROI report here.\r\n                      </a>\r\n                    </p>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                      </tr>\r\n                    </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;\">\r\n                      <strong>Trigger a review through any of these steps:</strong>\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <ol style=\"margin:0 0 16px 18px; padding:0; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;\">\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Open or update a PR.</li>\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Comment: <strong>@coderabbitai review</strong></li>\r\n                      <li>Resolve one suggestion to move forward.</li>\r\n                    </ol>\r\n\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;\">\r\n                      <strong>Quick learning resources:</strong>\r\n                      <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.\" style=\"color:#ff5a1f; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:200;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                        Quickstart docs\r\n                      </a>\r\n                         • \r\n                          <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBLZXR3SHhucmNCQWFGS2NKOHp1YTlwUTdDenRLUTZudz09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8veW91dHUuYmUvcGxBRkFqTUlNbTQiLCJpbnRlcm5hbCI6IjliYjgwYjY0YjExMWYyOWViNzAxIiwibGlua19pZCI6MTIwMX0/66fbe3e795cac79cd033b60c41bce552b66a1c7e41a1890352e8c3a1641dcd3e\" style=\"color:#ff5a1f; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:200;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                        Watch demo\r\n                      </a>\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                  \r\n                      \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                 <br>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n                   \r\n\r\n                    \r\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n                      <tbody><tr>\r\n                        <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 18px 0;\">\r\n                          <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n                            <tbody><tr>\r\n                              <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff5a1f\" style=\"border-radius:8px;\">\r\n                                <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBLZXR3SHhucmNCQWFGS2NKOHp1YTlwUTdDenRLUTZudz09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vYXBwLmNvZGVyYWJiaXQuYWkvbG9naW4iLCJpbnRlcm5hbCI6IjliYjgwYjY0YjExMWYyOWViNzAxIiwibGlua19pZCI6Mzg4fQ/88e6cac376cefa6364515b3aac34c49740c838afc1f29f86310c5c0b5b60d874\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:10px 18px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                                  Trigger your first review\r\n                                </a>\r\n                              </td>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                          </tbody></table>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                      </tr>\r\n                    </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n                \r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;\">\r\n                      Best,<br>\r\n                      Preet\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n              </tbody></table>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          \r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:12px 24px 6px 24px;font-size:11px;color:#6b6b6b;\">\r\n              CodeRabbit<br>201 Spear Street Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 24px 18px 24px;font-size:10px;color:#6b6b6b;\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAPKetwHxnrcBAaFKcJ8zua9pQ7CztKQ6nw==\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsubscribe</a>\r\n               | \r\n              <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAPKetwHxnrcBAaFKcJ8zua9pQ7CztKQ6nw==\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Manage preferences</a>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody