olders, file\r\n    types, or test paths in your config. Path-based reviews\r\n    [https://docs.coderabbit.ai/guides/review-instructions#path-based-instructions].\r\n 2. Teach your style: Use @coderabbitai commands in PRs (e.g., @coderabbitai\r\n    always enforce camelCase). CodeRabbit remembers and applies these rules in\r\n    future reviews. Review commands\r\n    [https://docs.coderabbit.ai/reference/review-commands].\r\n 3. Chat directly: Use @coderabbitai chat in review comments to explain\r\n    feedback, request alternatives, or modify suggestions. Chat docs\r\n    [https://docs.coderabbit.ai/guide/chat].\r\n\r\nWatch CodeRabbit in action\r\n[https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/CustomizeCodeRabbitinunder%20optimized%20Mar%209,%202026,%203-55-53%20PM_01KKAD0SKTFC3C170VGJ3QFSNQ.gif]\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ymSv6kIsSNc\r\nWatch demos\r\n[https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbCmxae-uzfdtD5oiFjua336Ktn5LXG_1]\r\n\r\nConfigure CodeRabbit [https://app.coderabbit.ai/organization/settings]\r\n\r\nNeed help?\r\n\r\nJoin our daily Office Hours [https://www.coderabbit.ai/office-hours]  •  Join\r\nDiscord [https://discord.gg/coderabbit]  •  Email support\r\n[support@coderabbit.ai]\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nAravind\r\n\r\nCodeRabbit\r\n201 Spear Street Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105 Follow us:  LinkedIn\r\n[https://www.linkedin.com/company/coderabbitai]  |  X\r\n[https://x.com/coderabbitai]  |  Discord [https://discord.gg/coderabbit]  | \r\nReddit [https://www.reddit.com/r/coderabbit/] Unsubscribe [https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAKeGuAGmhrgBAaFUnG2uchPv1x-QUdBTTg==]  |  Manage preferences [https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAKeGuAGmhrgBAaFUnG2uchPv1x-QUdBTTg==]', 'Your 14-day trial starts with Security Review on every PR', 'hello@coderabbit.ai', 'The CodeRabbit Team', '[\"umair7@dahimail.com\"]', '[]', '[]', '<20261019144140.84e52b3815541d71@cio127296.coderabbit.ai>', NULL, '[]', NULL,