(281, '13f32253-73c5-423d-a55c-cce24ecd277a', 154, 25, 'inbound', 'contact', NULL, 'message', '\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;color:#e9e6de;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">\r\n    See what your changes affect—with blast radius analysis, architecture insights, and security review.\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background-color:#e9e6de;\">\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td class=\"page-gutter\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\r\n\r\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #e4e1d9;border-radius:10px;\">\r\n\r\n          <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td class=\"logo-cell\" style=\"padding:20px 24px 0;\">\r\n              <img src=\"https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/Orange_Typemark_980b58e321%20(1)_01KJVTPRWP9W6921PDWABPJBXG.png\" width=\"160\" height=\"25\" alt=\"CodeRabbit\">\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:14px;\"> </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"content-gutter\" style=\"padding:0 24px 24px;\">\r\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e1d9;border-radius:8px;\">\r\n                <tbody><tr>\r\n                  <td class=\"content-cell\" style=\"padding:24px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#111111;\">\r\n\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Hi 8umairali,</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Your CodeRabbit trial is live, but you haven’t reviewed your first pull request yet.</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Whether you wrote the code or used AI, a second look helps. <strong>CodeRabbit Advanced looks beyond the lines you changed to help you spot issues and understand what else might be affected.</strong></p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Put your next PR to the test with:</p>\r\n                    <ul style=\"margin:0 0 22px 18px;padding:0;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Blast radius analysis:</strong> See which downstream components and dependencies your changes could affect.</li>\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Architecture impact review:</strong> Understand how a PR changes system responsibilities and relationships.</li>\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>PR security review:</strong> Evaluate findings with severity, exploitability, and reachability context so you know what to address first.</li>\r\n                      <li><strong>Automated tests and one-click fixes:</strong> Turn review findings into fixes and strengthen test coverage.</li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px;\">\r\n                      <tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#ff5a1f\" style=\"border-radius:6px;text-align:center;mso-padding-alt:13px 22px;\"><a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBxTXR3SDVqTGNCQWFGWWlEdWw3LVR0SDNlWWRBZUpQQT09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vYXBwLmNvZGVyYWJiaXQuYWkvIiwiaW50ZXJuYWwiOiI5YmI4MGI2M2U5ZTkwMWZhOGNiNzAxIiwibGlua19pZCI6ODUxfQ/f182087564d7a834ebcfbd2b347b74c1233be8a842ff2949c1d46e2c1cc308b6\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid #ff5a1f;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;text-decoration:none;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Review your first PR →</a></td></tr>\r\n                    </tbody></table>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Start with a PR you’re already working on. Give yourself a clearer picture before you merge.</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Questions? Reply to this email or reach us at <a href=\"mailto:support@coderabbit.ai\" style=\"color:#b83b0e;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">support@coderabbit.ai</a>.</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Best,<br>Preet</p>\r\n\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n              </tbody></table>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 24px 10px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:17px;color:#6b6b6b;\">\r\n              CodeRabbit<br>\r\n              201 Spear Street, Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 24px 18px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:16px;color:#6b6b6b;\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAPqMtwH5jLcBAaFYiDul7-TtH3eYdAeJPA==\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                Unsubscribe\r\n              </a>\r\n               | \r\n              <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAPqMtwH5jLcBAaFYiDul7-TtH3eYdAeJPA==\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                Manage preferences\r\n              </a>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/o/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBxTXR3SDVqTGNCQWFGWWlEdWw3LVR0SDNlWWRBZUpQQT09In0=\" style=\"height: 1px !important; max-height: 1px !important; max-width: 1px !important; width: 1px !important; display: none !important;\" alt=\"\">', 'See what your changes affect—with blast radius analysis, architecture insights,\r\nand security review.\r\n\r\nCodeRabbit\r\n[https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/Orange_Typemark_980b58e321%20(1)_01KJVTPRWP9W6921PDWABPJBXG.png]\r\n \r\n\r\nHi 8umairali,\r\n\r\nYour CodeRabbit trial is live, but you haven’t reviewed your first pull request\r\nyet.\r\n\r\nWhether you wrote the code or used AI, a second look helps. CodeRabbit Advanced\r\nlooks beyond the lines you changed to help you spot issues and understand what\r\nelse might be affected.\r\n\r\nPut your next PR to the test with:\r\n\r\n * Blast radius analysis: See which downstream components and dependencies your\r\n   changes could affect.\r\n * Architecture impact review: Understand how a PR changes system\r\n   responsibilities and relationships.\r\n * PR security review: Evaluate findings with severity, exploitability, and\r\n   reachability context so you know what to address first.\r\n * Automated tests and one-click fixes: Turn review findings into fixes and\r\n   strengthen test coverage.\r\n\r\nReview your first PR → [https://app.coderabbit.ai/]\r\n\r\nStart with a PR you’re already working on. Give yourself a clearer picture\r\nbefore you merge.\r\n\r\nQuestions? Reply to this email or reach us at support@coderabbit.ai\r\n[support@coderabbit.ai].\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nThe CodeRabbit Team\r\n\r\nCodeRabbit\r\n201 Spear Street, Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105 Unsubscribe [https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAPqMtwH5jLcBAaFYiDul7-TtH3eYdAeJPA==]  |  Manage preferences [https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAPqMtwH5jLcBAaFYiDul7-TtH3eYdAeJPA==]', 'Your next PR deserves a deeper review', 'manpreet@coderabbit.ai', 'Preet from CodeRabbit', '[\"umair