(285, '47141ba5-cd12-43f3-b28c-0cc7a0607374', 158, 26, 'inbound', 'contact', NULL, 'message', '\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;color:#e9e6de;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">\r\n    See what your changes affect—with blast radius analysis, architecture insights, and security review.\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background-color:#e9e6de;\">\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td class=\"page-gutter\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\r\n\r\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #e4e1d9;border-radius:10px;\">\r\n\r\n          <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td class=\"logo-cell\" style=\"padding:20px 24px 0;\">\r\n              <img src=\"https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/Orange_Typemark_980b58e321%20(1)_01KJVTPRWP9W6921PDWABPJBXG.png\" width=\"160\" height=\"25\" alt=\"CodeRabbit\">\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:14px;\"> </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"content-gutter\" style=\"padding:0 24px 24px;\">\r\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e1d9;border-radius:8px;\">\r\n                <tbody><tr>\r\n                  <td class=\"content-cell\" style=\"padding:24px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#111111;\">\r\n\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Hi 9umairali,</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Your CodeRabbit trial is live, but you haven’t reviewed your first pull request yet.</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Whether you wrote the code or used AI, a second look helps. <strong>CodeRabbit Advanced looks beyond the lines you changed to help you spot issues and understand what else might be affected.</strong></p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Put your next PR to the test with:</p>\r\n                    <ul style=\"margin:0 0 22px 18px;padding:0;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Blast radius analysis:</strong> See which downstream components and dependencies your changes could affect.</li>\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Architecture impact review:</strong> Understand how a PR changes system responsibilities and relationships.</li>\r\n                      <li style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>PR security review:</strong> Evaluate findings with severity, exploitability, and reachability context so you know what to address first.</li>\r\n                      <li><strong>Automated tests and one-click fixes:</strong> Turn review findings into fixes and strengthen test coverage.</li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px;\">\r\n                      <tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#ff5a1f\" style=\"border-radius:6px;text-align:center;mso-padding-alt:13px 22px;\"><a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBLZXR3SHhucmNCQWFGWjQ4TmstZ0hiZ0tkbWJoSlRUdz09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vYXBwLmNvZGVyYWJiaXQuYWkvIiwiaW50ZXJuYWwiOiI5YmI4MGI2NGIxMTFmMjllYjcwMSIsImxpbmtfaWQiOjg1MX0/341373ad268fb58e0fd40c609fffb3b5229a66ab808095469d78a9d6d321156d\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid #ff5a1f;border-radius:6px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;text-decoration:none;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Review your first PR →</a></td></tr>\r\n                    </tbody></table>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Start with a PR you’re already working on. Give yourself a clearer picture before you merge.</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Questions? Reply to this email or reach us at <a href=\"mailto:support@coderabbit.ai\" style=\"color:#b83b0e;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">support@coderabbit.ai</a>.</p>\r\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;\">Best,<br>Preet</p>\r\n\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n              </tbody></table>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 24px 10px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:17px;color:#6b6b6b;\">\r\n              CodeRabbit<br>\r\n              201 Spear Street, Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 24px 18px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:16px;color:#6b6b6b;\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAPKetwHxnrcBAaFZ48Nk-gHbgKdmbhJTTw==\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                Unsubscribe\r\n              </a>\r\n               | \r\n              <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAPKetwHxnrcBAaFZ48Nk-gHbgKdmbhJTTw==\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                Manage preferences\r\n              </a>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/o/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU2J1QXNMQVBLZXR3SHhucmNCQWFGWjQ4TmstZ0hiZ0tkbWJoSlRUdz09In0=\" style=\"height: 1px !important; max-height: 1px !important; max-width: 1px !important; width: 1px !important; display: none !important;\" alt=\"\">', 'See what your changes affect—with blast radius analysis, architecture insights,\r\nand security review.\r\n\r\nCodeRabbit\r\n[https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/Orange_Typemark_980b58e321%20(1)_01KJVTPRWP9W6921PDWABPJBXG.png]\r\n \r\n\r\nHi 9umairali,\r\n\r\nYour CodeRabbit trial is live, but you haven’t reviewed your first pull request\r\nyet.\r\n\r\nWhether you wrote the code or used AI, a second look helps. CodeRabbit Advanced\r\nlooks beyond the lines you changed to help you spot issues and understand what\r\nelse might be affected.\r\n\r\nPut your next PR to the test with:\r\n\r\n * Blast radius analysis: See which downstream components and dependencies your\r\n   changes could affect.\r\n * Architecture impact review: Understand how a PR changes system\r\n   responsibilities and relationships.\r\n * PR security review: Evaluate findings with severity, exploitability, and\r\n   reachability context so you know what to address first.\r\n * Automated tests and one-click fixes: Turn review findings into fixes and\r\n   strengthen test coverage.\r\n\r\nReview your first PR → [https://app.coderabbit.ai/]\r\n\r\nStart with a PR you’re already working on. Give yourself a clearer picture\r\nbefore you merge.\r\n\r\nQuestions? Reply to this email or reach us at support@coderabbit.ai\r\n[support@coderabbit.ai].\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nThe CodeRabbit Team\r\n\r\nCodeRabbit\r\n201 Spear Street, Suite 1200, San Francisco, CA 94105 Unsubscribe [https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSbuAsLAPKetwHxnrcBAaFZ48Nk-gHbgKdmbhJTTw==]  |  Manage preferences [https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSbuAsLAPKetwHxnrcBAaFZ48Nk-gHbgKdmbhJTTw==]', 'Your next PR deserves a deeper review', 'manpreet@coderabbit.ai', 'Preet from CodeRabbit', '[\"umair2@dahimail.com\"]', '[]', '[]', '<20261020151742.73118a116a5a21dc@cio127296.coderabbit.ai>', NULL, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'neutral', NULL, 'delivered', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-10-20 13:17:42', '2026-10-20 13:17:42', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 'INBOX', '2026-10-20 13:18:10', '2026-10-20 13:18:10', NULL),
(286, '48e4ea53-a8c2-499a-b6b6-3b0e71ce6854', 159, 19, 'inbound', 'contact', NULL, 'message', '\n\n\n	<center>\n		<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" bgcolor=\"#f4ecfa\" class=\"gwfw\">\n			<tr>\n				<td style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n					<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"m-shell\">\n						<tr>\n							<td class=\"td\" style=\"width:600px; min-width:600px; font-size:0pt; line-height:0pt; padding:0; margin:0; font-weight:normal;\">\n								<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n									<tr>\n										<td class=\"mpx-10\">\n											\n											\n													\n														\n															\n														\n													\n															\n												 \n											\n											\n											<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n												<tr>\n													<td class=\"gradient pt-10\" style=\"border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; padding-top: 10px;\" bgcolor=\"#f3189e\">\n														<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n															<tr>\n																<td style=\"border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\">\n																	\n																	<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#162330\">\n																		<tr>\n																			<td class=\"img-center p-30 px-15\" style=\"font-size:0pt; line-height:0pt; text-align:left; padding: 30px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;\">\n																				<a href=\"https://www.fbr.gov.pk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://e.fbr.gov.pk/images/email/fbr_logo.png\" width=\"100\" alt=\"\"></a>\n																			</td>\n																			<td class=\"img-center p-30 px-15\" style=\"font-size:0pt; line-height:0pt; text-align:right; padding: 30px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;\">\n																				<a href=\"https://www.iris.fbr.gov.pk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://e.fbr.gov.pk/images/email/iris_logo.png\" width=\"120\" alt=\"\"></a>\n																			</td>\n																		</tr>\n																	</table>\n																	\n											\n																	\n																	<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																		<tr>\n																			<td class=\"px-50 mpx-15\" style=\"padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 50px;\">\n																				\n																				<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																					<tr>\n																						<td class=\"pb-50\" style=\"padding-bottom: 30px;\">\n																							<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																								<tr>\n																									<td class=\"fluid-img img-center pb-30\" style=\"font-size:0pt; line-height:0pt; text-align:left; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-top: 10px\">\n																										<img src=\"https://e.fbr.gov.pk/images/email/mail_icon.png\" width=\"283\" alt=\"\">\n																									</td>\n																								</tr>\n																								\n																									\n																										\n																									\n																								\n																							\n																								<tr>\n																									<td class=\"text-16 lh-26 a-center pb-25\" style=\"font-size:16px; color:#282828; font-family:\'PT Sans\', Arial, sans-serif; min-width:auto !important; line-height: 26px; text-align:left; padding-bottom: 25px;\">\n																										<strong>Dear Sir/Madam,</strong>\n																										<br>\n																										 <p>Dear FAZLI AZIM.,</p>\n<p>We acknowledge and thank you for filing your Income Tax Return for tax year 2026. Your act would certainly help the nation to grow and prosper.</p>\n<p>Inland Revenue Service (IRS)</p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px; text-align: right;\">FAZLI AZIM. محترم</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">مالی سال 2026 کے سالانہ ٹیکس گوشوارہ جمع کروانے کا شکریہ۔ آپ کی طرف سے اس قانونی فریضے کی انجام دہی ملک کی ترقی میں یقینا معاون ثابت ہوگی ۔</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">ان لینڈ ریونیو سروس (آئی آر ایس)</p>\n\n																										\n																									</td>\n																								</tr>\n																								\n																									\n																										\n																											\n																												\n																													\n																												\n																											\n																								\n																									<td align=\"left\">\n																										\n																										<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 200px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n																											<tr>\n																												<td class=\"btn-16 c-white l-white\" bgcolor=\"#20a77d\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:20px; mso-padding-alt:15px 35px; font-family:\'PT Sans\', Arial, sans-serif; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase; border-radius:25px; min-width:auto !important; color:#ffffff;\">\n																													<a href=\"https://iris.fbr.gov.pk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link c-white\" style=\"display: block; padding: 15px 35px; text-decoration:none; color:#ffffff;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n																														<span class=\"link c-white\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:#ffffff;\">LOGIN TO IRIS</span>\n																													</a>\n																												</td>\n																											</tr>\n																											\n																										</table>\n																										\n																									</td>\n																								\n																											<tr>\n																									\n																										\n																									\n																								</tr>\n																							</table>\n																						</td>\n																					</tr>\n																				</table>\n																				\n											\n																				\n																				<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																					<tr>\n																						<td class=\"pb-50\" style=\"padding-bottom: 50px;\">\n																							<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																								<tr>\n																									<td class=\"img\" height=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#ebebeb\" style=\"font-size:0pt; line-height:0pt; text-align:left;\"> </td>\n																								</tr>\n																							</table>\n																						</td>\n																					</tr>\n																				</table>\n																				\n											\n																				\n																				<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																					<tr>\n																						<td class=\"pb-15\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n																							<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n																								<tr>\n																									<td class=\"title-26 a-center pb-35\" style=\" min-width:auto !important; text-align:center; padding-bottom: 35px;\">\n																										<img src=\"https://e.fbr.gov.pk/images/email/taxasaan.png?no-proxy\">\n																									</td>\n																								</tr>\n																								<tr>\n																									<td class=\"title-26 a-center pb-35\" style=\"font-size:26px; line-height:30px; color:#282828; font-family:\'PT Sans\', Arial, sans-serif; min-width:auto !important; text-align:left; padding-bottom: 35px;\">\n																										<strong>Tax Asaan Mobile Application</strong>\n																									</td>\n																								</tr>\n																								<tr>\n																									<td class=\"pb-35\" style=\"pa