 all;\">\n    Five steps that make your first build a great one.\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"outer-table\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" bgcolor=\"#EEECEB\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"outer-padding\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 40px 20px;\">\n\n        <table class=\"email-container\" width=\"650\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 650px; max-width: 650px; border-collapse: collapse;\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\">\n\n          \n          <tr class=\"visual-desktop\">\n            <td style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 0; padding: 0;\">\n              <a href=\"https://click.base44.com/f/a/65HzjRfbyqH_ATv4tgkZRw~~/AAQRxRA~/ZTP-v8QW9rsWSuIgmcnocBYHkKC2G2q5Dyqx2u7B3zYyrDV1B9gliSYzty6fGz1KziZX2fUeOluFYfKGuN2sNgbno0ziX3FM3fkNFY1ptCzn50N1ejs0wZFF2ZsEPucHIqzujFxhO9hfLY3V3YOVy-cJeBsHtwVgLWLLRPV6t7Y8XNIvoS6W2_ti0sInJD42hVP1ZV3s3Wi8B3Lpw4OrCAurCHPy29mVtSmk8AI8wCI~\" style=\"display: block; color: #1e1e24;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://braze-images.com/appboy/communication/assets/image_assets/images/6a4cf272c26d2f0083f549ab/original.png?1783427697\" width=\"650\" height=\"240\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 650px; border-width: 0;\"></a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          \n          <tr class=\"visual-mobile\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <td style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 0; padding: 0;\">\n              <a href=\"https://click.base44.com/f/a/R23srnP5Nr8mO7Jfjz3Fyg~~/AAQRxRA~/ZTP-v8QW9rsWSuIgmcnocBYHkKC2G2q5Dyqx2u7B3zYyrDV1B9gliSYzty6fGz1KziZX2fUeOluFYfKGuN2sNgbno0ziX3FM3fkNFY1ptCzn50N1ejs0wZFF2ZsEPucHIqzujFxhO9hfLY3V3YOVy0m5cQponVla-2eIowhtcI2nvE2V8Qvp3uNoJeII4Sl5mI1DDgknYAV4W5PGi3JyCL7SK3_B8z2FLrhjETI6U4E~\" style=\"display: block; color: #1e1e24;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://braze-images.com/appboy/communication/assets/image_assets/images/6a4cf27684b0a900839fc3a3/original.png?1783427701\" width=\"360\" height=\"170\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: none; width: 100%; border-width: 0;\"></a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          \n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"body-outer\" style=\"padding: 30px;\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding-bottom: 30px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                    Hey 13umairali,<br><br>\n                    <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">We\'re so glad you\'re here! 🎉</span>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding-bottom: 30px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                    You\'ve got ideas, and now you can turn them into real products. Describe what you want in your own words – and watch Base44 build it.\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                    Five steps to a great first build:\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                \n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding-bottom: 30px;\">\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n                      \n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                          <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                            <tr>\n                              <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n                                <div style=\"background-color: #3b51e5; width: 48px; height: 48px; line-height: 48px;\" align=\"center\">\n                                  <span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;\">1</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </td>\n                              <td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Start with a plan</p>\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; margin: 0;\">Turn on Plan mode and map out your idea before you build.</p>\n                              </td>\n                            </tr>\n                          </table>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n\n                      \n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                          <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                            <tr>\n                              <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n                                <div style=\"background-color: #3b51e5; width: 48px; height: 48px; line-height: 48px;\" align=\"center\">\n                                  <span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;\">2</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </td>\n                              <td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Details make the difference</p>\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; margin: 0;\">The more specific you are, the better the build. Add a reference you love, or migrate an existing project into Base44.</p>\n                              </td>\n                            </tr>\n                          </table>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n\n                      \n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                          <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                            <tr>\n                              <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n                                <div style=\"background-color: #3b51e5; width: 48px; height: 48px; line-height: 48px;\" align=\"center\">\n                                  <span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;\">3</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </td>\n                              <td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Skip the blank page</p>\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; margin: 0;\">Pick a <a href=\"https://click.base44.com/f/a/0vvpTUnrcxjtLu5qcH6I8A~~/AAQRxRA~/vjIcmcAIRtOnBuZNLmEUhY4AFyYErcTvo0zTVwmw8tPp1tMAPOgmKmZHuY2mbiEN0Hn8d5Syy7eK7NUguYaswWi79-OsSCZl2U6v6auDRSLe2XIOodfHrdRaacfl8MNuy2v3T6IQS6pGtmLBo_eLaRJssA8uNGK2Ri8wwhDXHdwVAxPaotLMvZWweisJ-2uGVTUajeUv-jRGZBrZbqqCM9G5pdscZW33sQ-UTfBCQ-RqUHIGTOq35OyeHKKAtzseLs_bKuKXCOOXb_pjrLCzBw~~\" style=\"color: #1e1e24;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">template</a> and make it yours.</p>\n                              </td>\n                            </tr>\n                          </table>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n\n                      \n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                          <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                            <tr>\n                              <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n                                <div style=\"background-color: #3b51e5; width: 48px; height: 48px; line-height: 48px;\" align=\"center\">\n                                  <span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;\">4</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </td>\n                              <td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Design it your way</p>\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; margin: 0;\">Click any element in Edit mode and style it on the spot.</p>\n                              </td>\n                            </tr>\n                          </table>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n\n                      \n                      <tr>\n                        <td>\n                          <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                            <tr>\n                              <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n                                <div style=\"background-color: #3b51e5; width: 48px; height: 48px; line-height: 48px;\" align=\"center\">\n                                  <span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;\">5</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </td>\n                              <td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Go live and share</p>\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; margin: 0;\">One click on Publish, and your app is live. Now explore your app’s dashboard and discover everything it comes with.</p>\n                              </td>\n                            </tr>\n                          </table>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding-bottom: 30px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; color: #1e1e24;\">\n                    Want to go deeper? Check out our <a href=\"https://click.base44.com/f/a/Pv0GmRgTQSzbfGvOgyPAgQ~~/AAQRxRA~/Li5Fc4-pEHQPr7JBIwtLT5L596-SkHUOeNMZCIRA5Jk_hX6sPk7LMG9ybvTRu0TWAdMAvEU-EoyuuqWZ6l6PwJx5rE3HhSI_p84uwAjj5pgXgtxxQk0PTp4_v4vmPf2N59UrJhdR9qXakGi47VQGTZdLwChGoQ6ycyj6hDwoeZE5KO89UOisPFtlgz2Q7mppSh_eazU650ld95R4R3K-YCCgpRZ94ncgJy_gLR8bvsBNmKnbpwk_z9MQUHGJNPVRsKgxL2iS231KtBil6kfEvsE8NRFOMTZ8KIm96kFEqFU~\" style=\"color: #1e1e24;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">guide</a> →<br><br>\n                    Got questions? Chat with our experts on <a href=\"https://click.base44.com/f/a/HtgYB-nYVfpnpIP4X_lbIQ~~/AAQRxRA~/P-awMIOv8qLPJX2N5Cu9MzwidNrOAWPqv-vjLN04GI81mTZ2hCM3Z8UPvw_sRawa2wVWwuDb3eOn6DZDW1e0GVuUtrpafQ3r07ozh296Ip6-DVkHBuvZ87ZDRa7lj3IYj0c8QwShU4pz48J8x6JYnQ~~\" style=\"color: #1e1e24;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discord</a> →\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding-bottom: 30px;\">\n                    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\