r\n      \r\n      \r\n    \r\n    \r\n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto\">\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n<div class=\"hse-column hse-size-12\">\r\n  <div class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\"><table class=\"hse-image-wrapper\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td class=\"hs_padded\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; text-align:center; padding:10px 20px; font-size:0px\">\r\n        <a href=\"https://m.qodo.ai/e3t/Ctc/X+113/d38jhy04/VXdbBj6-6-lyN8t0DTdLbc-LW7CpFKy5Wsy2nN2jjSyd3qgz0W95jsWP6lZ3lxW5QfSlB6nBZQ8W8XtYBP1SZjFpW4Nx2v29ls-xZVtkYT-5HdgJpW17y1Px561hwBVhdQkd9kXYk7W2ygv1c4Jz72YW7HVVGk4DyC3XW76G9dn6Fgb58W8g1p312YFzbSMpv5vL6ghJXN56f7GVql_THW4QkZrn4GvPhGW3ZcJpn58ZLJKW4FskHT5W61fvN7TSbZP9X6g_N2zrxjZZHr5CN5sgzPyTcS7RW78myMZ6QZ0L3W4mVltw8-753QW1M8KKr22zk2FW6flwyL1DcMc-W1M3QRZ23qGvRW1d0mdx1BmPcWW4v59_36czpZrW6F5TsB5XNMN5W6729WH1tlVh1W5x7_p67Kl4dlW7HZbDt6CQSvHW8p27wn5LCT0Tdk5nSP04\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00a4bd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n        <img alt=\"qodo-logo\" src=\"https://m.qodo.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/qodo-logo.png?width=420&amp;upscale=true&amp;name=qodo-logo.png\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; border:none; max-width:100%; font-size:16px\" width=\"210\" align=\"middle\">\r\n        </a>\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table></div>\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 20px\"><div class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\"><div class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.2\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2\">Hi there,</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\">Welcome to Qodo. We’re excited you’re here!</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\">Qodo is helping thousands of engineering teams catch critical issues early, surface high-signal feedback, and maintain consistent code quality standards for fast-moving, AI-driven development.</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\"><strong>How to get started with automated PR reviews</strong> (in 30 seconds):</p>\r\n<ol style=\"line-height:175%\">\r\n<li>Install <a href=\"https://m.qodo.ai/e3t/Ctc/X+113/d38jhy04/VXdbBj6-6-lyN8t0DTdLbc-LW7CpFKy5Wsy2nN2jjSyd3qgz0W95jsWP6lZ3mRW2k9cs07xjSKSW8nDDny9kXTPtW2gfszq7H0V82W4Yr2Cs2W35MXW92FwQL7gFcm_W3r1bFc3Z5Fs5W63-Hm66_sLZwW3k3pgC92DL9tW7m-pr786ZfRWN49Wc6f-4h6MW43TRrC839zfSW1W-GQ1668hlPN1Rw6pYn1yt4W4rDklm54HhTyW7xy_pM8Pv4VLN6by4b5XwnZCN2r6Ngl4mhWMVY0bz-1CvkY9W6Z61Pk6hbb1BW5gQf7J3vXr3vW3KNMY28g6q8yW31gkMc42_GZvW5NF3YH8Xlmn3W1BqsXl7hdhpCW8cxt4890dWCBW36fB6z1lZlpwW46Txfp1sgs5nW5hxQyS2N5qhLN5VwxDr8222kVGvLBc48jSTtf998KXF04\" style=\"color:#00a4bd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Qodo Git Plugin</a> (GitHub, Bitbucket, GitLab, Azure DevOps)<span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span>and connect your repo.</li>\r\n<li>Let Qodo run. It triggers automatically.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.2; background-color:#ffffff\">⇒<a href=\"https://m.qodo.ai/e3t/Ctc/X+113/d38jhy04/VXdbBj6-6-lyN8t0DTdLbc-LW7CpFKy5Wsy2nN2jjSyd3qgz0W95jsWP6lZ3lrW28FvLp4KvK3SW4-6SBT6LpKWXW187rnc5P6KSQW54Bljk39H9R_W6gCG3G3L2Sz6W2J